WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:11.400
Step 1: Every pupil signs in. Tap Cloud, then sign in with the login card.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.600
Step 2: Open the team game and tap Share. One pupil opens the game the team will build.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Choose Collaborate (live!). It only shows when the pupil is signed in.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.400
Step 4: Tick up to 5 teammates. Press Start collaboration. Invite more by display name.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:32.000
Step 5: Teammates join from Cloud. Cloud → Collaborations, then tap the team’s game.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.400
Step 6: Build together, live. Changes and coloured pointers appear at once. Tap Leave to finish.
